<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "When you open a channel's Space, a character picker appears before the map loads. Pick who you want to be — the classic Hero or one of six adventuring classes."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "The Roster")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Eight characters are available: the Hero, plus the Sorceress, Knight, Archer, Barbarian, Rogue, Cleric and Monk. Each card shows an animated walking preview so you can see the sprite before you commit, and every character has its own attack animation too."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_space", "Choosing")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Click a card to enter the map wearing that character. Everyone else in the Space sees your choice immediately. The picker appears each time you enter, starting on your last pick, so you can switch characters whenever you like."
  )}
</p>
